lore_blurb = "Official USAF records: 12,618 reported UFO sightings logged between 1952 and 1969. The report concludes the majority are explained phenomena. What it does not explain is why 701 cases remain classified as UNEXPLAINED — or why the physical evidence logs for those cases are missing entirely from the public archive.\n\nThis volume covers years 1952–1958. Pay close attention to the Levelland incident. Someone added a handwritten margin note that was not part of the original report. It reads: 'They matched.'"
